  "id": "M1#4933",
  "en": "My name is "
 },
 {
  "id": "M1#4934",
  "en": "What's wrong?"
 },
 {
  "id": "M1#4935",
  "en": "You should at least answer when spoken to."
 },
 {
  "id": "M1#4936",
  "en": "Say, "
 },
 {
  "id": "M1#4937",
  "en": ", why do you"
 },
 {
  "id": "M1#4938",
  "en": "always come to school?"
 },
 {
  "id": "M1#4939",
  "en": "Because I come to see you, Marie."
 },
 {
  "id": "M1#4940",
  "en": "Then, "
